<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#S3.SS4.SSS3" title="In 3.4 Spatial Discretizations ‣ 3 Discretizations of the Continuous Problem ‣ A Mathematical Explanation of Transformers for Large Language Models and GPTs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">3.4.3 </span>Computing the Discrete Solutions <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="u^{(3+J)/M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>u</mi><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>J</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>/</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">u^{(3+J)/M}</annotation></semantics></math> in (<span class="ltx_ref"></span>)</span></a></li>
